{"slug":"two-sum","titulo":"Two Sum","seccion":"interview","dificultad":"easy","etiquetas":["array","hash-map"],"enunciado":"Given an array of integers and a target, return the indices of the two numbers that add up to the target. Each input has exactly one solution and you may not use the same element twice.\n\nExample: nums = [2, 7, 11, 15], target = 9 -> [0, 1] because 2 + 7 = 9.\n\nCan you do it in a single pass?","markdown":"# Two Sum\n\n**Section:** Interview Challenge · **Difficulty:** easy · **Tags:** array, hash-map\n\nGiven an array of integers `nums` and an integer `target`, return the indices of\nthe two numbers that add up to `target`. Each input has exactly one solution and\nyou may not use the same element twice.\n\n**Example**\n\n```\nnums = [2, 7, 11, 15], target = 9  ->  [0, 1]   (2 + 7 = 9)\nnums = [3, 2, 4],      target = 6  ->  [1, 2]\nnums = [3, 3],         target = 6  ->  [0, 1]\n```\n\n**Idea:** one pass with a hash map. For each number look up `target - n`;\nif it was seen before, you are done. Otherwise store the number with its index.\nTime O(n), space O(n).\n","fecha":null,"youtube":{"video":null,"short":null},"codigo":[{"lenguaje":"python","nombre":"PYTHON","archivo":"two_sum.py","texto":"# Two Sum - ayotl.dev\ndef two_sum(nums, target):\n    seen = {}\n    for i, n in enumerate(nums):\n        rest = target - n\n        if rest in seen:\n            return [seen[rest], i]\n        seen[n] = i\n    return []\n\n\nprint(two_sum([2, 7, 11, 15], 9))\nprint(two_sum([3, 2, 4], 6))\nprint(two_sum([3, 3], 6))","lineas":[[["# Two Sum - ayotl.dev","comment"]],[["def","kw"],[" ","ws"],["two_sum","func"],["(","punct"],["nums","ident"],[",","punct"],[" ","ws"],["target","ident"],["):","punct"]],[["    ","ws"],["seen","ident"],[" ","ws"],["=","punct"],[" ","ws"],["{}","punct"]],[["    ","ws"],["for","kw"],[" ","ws"],["i","ident"],[",","punct"],[" ","ws"],["n","ident"],[" ","ws"],["in","kw"],[" ","ws"],["enumerate","builtin"],["(","punct"],["nums","ident"],["):","punct"]],[["        ","ws"],["rest","ident"],[" ","ws"],["=","punct"],[" ","ws"],["target","ident"],[" ","ws"],["-","punct"],[" ","ws"],["n","ident"]],[["        ","ws"],["if","kw"],[" ","ws"],["rest","ident"],[" ","ws"],["in","kw"],[" ","ws"],["seen","ident"],[":","punct"]],[["            ","ws"],["return","kw"],[" ","ws"],["[","punct"],["seen","ident"],["[","punct"],["rest","ident"],["],","punct"],[" ","ws"],["i","ident"],["]","punct"]],[["        ","ws"],["seen","ident"],["[","punct"],["n","ident"],["]","punct"],[" ","ws"],["=","punct"],[" ","ws"],["i","ident"]],[["    ","ws"],["return","kw"],[" ","ws"],["[]","punct"]],[],[],[["print","builtin"],["(","punct"],["two_sum","ident"],["([","punct"],["2","number"],[",","punct"],[" ","ws"],["7","number"],[",","punct"],[" ","ws"],["11","number"],[",","punct"],[" ","ws"],["15","number"],["],","punct"],[" ","ws"],["9","number"],["))","punct"]],[["print","builtin"],["(","punct"],["two_sum","ident"],["([","punct"],["3","number"],[",","punct"],[" ","ws"],["2","number"],[",","punct"],[" ","ws"],["4","number"],["],","punct"],[" ","ws"],["6","number"],["))","punct"]],[["print","builtin"],["(","punct"],["two_sum","ident"],["([","punct"],["3","number"],[",","punct"],[" ","ws"],["3","number"],["],","punct"],[" ","ws"],["6","number"],["))","punct"]]],"comando":"python3 two_sum.py","salida":["[0, 1]","[1, 2]","[0, 1]"],"ok":true},{"lenguaje":"c","nombre":"C","archivo":"two_sum.c","texto":"// Two Sum - ayotl.dev\n#include <stdio.h>\n\n#define SIZE 64\n\ntypedef struct { int key, idx, used; } Slot;\n\nstatic int slot(int key) {\n    return (key & 0x7fffffff) % SIZE;\n}\n\nvoid two_sum(int *nums, int n, int target) {\n    Slot t[SIZE] = {0};\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n        int rest = target - nums[i];\n        int h = slot(rest);\n        while (t[h].used) {\n            if (t[h].key == rest) {\n                printf(\"[%d, %d]\\n\",\n                       t[h].idx, i);\n                return;\n            }\n            h = (h + 1) % SIZE;\n        }\n        h = slot(nums[i]);\n        while (t[h].used)\n            h = (h + 1) % SIZE;\n        t[h].key = nums[i];\n        t[h].idx = i;\n        t[h].used = 1;\n    }\n    printf(\"[]\\n\");\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    int a[] = {2, 7, 11, 15};\n    int b[] = {3, 2, 4};\n    int c[] = {3, 3};\n    two_sum(a, 4, 9);\n    two_sum(b, 3, 6);\n    two_sum(c, 2, 6);\n    return 0;\n}","lineas":[[["// Two Sum - ayotl.dev","comment"]],[["#include <stdio.h>","preproc"]],[],[["#define SIZE 64","preproc"]],[],[["typedef","kw"],[" ","ws"],["struct","kw"],[" ","ws"],["{","punct"],[" ","ws"],["int","type"],[" ","ws"],["key","ident"],[",","punct"],[" ","ws"],["idx","ident"],[",","punct"],[" ","ws"],["used","ident"],[";","punct"],[" ","ws"],["}","punct"],[" ","ws"],["Slot","ident"],[";","punct"]],[],[["static","kw"],[" ","ws"],["int","type"],[" ","ws"],["slot","func"],["(","punct"],["int","type"],[" ","ws"],["key","ident"],[")","punct"],[" ","ws"],["{","punct"]],[["    ","ws"],["return","kw"],[" ","ws"],["(","punct"],["key","ident"],[" ","ws"],["&","punct"],[" ","ws"],["0x7fffffff","number"],[")","punct"],[" ","ws"],["%","punct"],[" ","ws"],["SIZE","ident"],[";","punct"]],[["}","punct"]],[],[["void","type"],[" ","ws"],["two_sum","func"],["(","punct"],["int","type"],[" ","ws"],["*","punct"],["nums","ident"],[",","punct"],[" ","ws"],["int","type"],[" ","ws"],["n","ident"],[",","punct"],[" ","ws"],["int","type"],[" ","ws"],["target","ident"],[")","punct"],[" ","ws"],["{","punct"]],[["    ","ws"],["Slot","ident"],[" ","ws"],["t","ident"],["[","punct"],["SIZE","ident"],["]","punct"],[" ","ws"],["=","punct"],[" ","ws"],["{","punct"],["0","number"],["};","punct"]],[["    ","ws"],["for","kw"],[" ","ws"],["(","punct"],["int","type"],[" ","ws"],["i","ident"],[" ","ws"],["=","punct"],[" ","ws"],["0","number"],[";","punct"],[" ","ws"],["i","ident"],[" ","ws"],["<","punct"],[" ","ws"],["n","ident"],[";","punct"],[" ","ws"],["i","ident"],["++)","pu