{"slug":"fizzbuzz","titulo":"FizzBuzz","seccion":"basic","dificultad":"easy","etiquetas":["loop","modulo"],"enunciado":"Print the numbers from 1 to N. For multiples of 3 print \"Fizz\" instead of the number, for multiples of 5 print \"Buzz\", and for numbers that are multiples of both print \"FizzBuzz\".\n\nExample: N = 15 -> 1 2 Fizz 4 Buzz Fizz 7 8 Fizz Buzz 11 Fizz 13 14 FizzBuzz","markdown":"# FizzBuzz\n\n**Section:** Basic Challenge · **Difficulty:** easy · **Tags:** loop, modulo\n\nPrint the numbers from 1 to N. For multiples of 3 print `Fizz` instead of the\nnumber, for multiples of 5 print `Buzz`, and for multiples of both print `FizzBuzz`.\n\n**Example** (N = 15)\n\n```\n1 2 Fizz 4 Buzz Fizz 7 8 Fizz Buzz 11 Fizz 13 14 FizzBuzz\n```\n\n**Idea:** check the \"both\" case first (15 divides) or build the word by\nappending `Fizz` and `Buzz` separately and print the number if it is empty.\n","fecha":null,"youtube":{"video":null,"short":null},"codigo":[{"lenguaje":"python","nombre":"PYTHON","archivo":"fizzbuzz.py","texto":"# FizzBuzz - ayotl.dev\ndef fizzbuzz(n):\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        word = \"\"\n        if i % 3 == 0:\n            word += \"Fizz\"\n        if i % 5 == 0:\n            word += \"Buzz\"\n        print(word or i, end=\" \")\n    print()\n\n\nfizzbuzz(15)","lineas":[[["# FizzBuzz - ayotl.dev","comment"]],[["def","kw"],[" ","ws"],["fizzbuzz","func"],["(","punct"],["n","ident"],["):","punct"]],[["    ","ws"],["for","kw"],[" ","ws"],["i","ident"],[" ","ws"],["in","kw"],[" ","ws"],["range","builtin"],["(","punct"],["1","number"],[",","punct"],[" ","ws"],["n","ident"],[" ","ws"],["+","punct"],[" ","ws"],["1","number"],["):","punct"]],[["        ","ws"],["word","ident"],[" ","ws"],["=","punct"],[" ","ws"],["\"\"","string"]],[["        ","ws"],["if","kw"],[" ","ws"],["i","ident"],[" ","ws"],["%","punct"],[" ","ws"],["3","number"],[" ","ws"],["==","punct"],[" ","ws"],["0","number"],[":","punct"]],[["            ","ws"],["word","ident"],[" ","ws"],["+=","punct"],[" ","ws"],["\"Fizz\"","string"]],[["        ","ws"],["if","kw"],[" ","ws"],["i","ident"],[" ","ws"],["%","punct"],[" ","ws"],["5","number"],[" ","ws"],["==","punct"],[" ","ws"],["0","number"],[":","punct"]],[["            ","ws"],["word","ident"],[" ","ws"],["+=","punct"],[" ","ws"],["\"Buzz\"","string"]],[["        ","ws"],["print","builtin"],["(","punct"],["word","ident"],[" ","ws"],["or","kw"],[" ","ws"],["i","ident"],[",","punct"],[" ","ws"],["end","ident"],["=","punct"],["\" \"","string"],[")","punct"]],[["    ","ws"],["print","builtin"],["()","punct"]],[],[],[["fizzbuzz","ident"],["(","punct"],["15","number"],[")","punct"]]],"comando":"python3 fizzbuzz.py","salida":["1 2 Fizz 4 Buzz Fizz 7 8 Fizz Buzz 11 Fizz 13 14 FizzBuzz "],"ok":true},{"lenguaje":"c","nombre":"C","archivo":"fizzbuzz.c","texto":"// FizzBuzz - ayotl.dev\n#include <stdio.h>\n\nvoid fizzbuzz(int n) {\n    for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {\n        if (i % 15 == 0)\n            printf(\"FizzBuzz \");\n        else if (i % 3 == 0)\n            printf(\"Fizz \");\n        else if (i % 5 == 0)\n            printf(\"Buzz \");\n        else\n            printf(\"%d \", i);\n    }\n    printf(\"\\n\");\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    fizzbuzz(15);\n    return 0;\n}","lineas":[[["// FizzBuzz - ayotl.dev","comment"]],[["#include <stdio.h>","preproc"]],[],[["void","type"],[" ","ws"],["fizzbuzz","func"],["(","punct"],["int","type"],[" ","ws"],["n","ident"],[")","punct"],[" ","ws"],["{","punct"]],[["    ","ws"],["for","kw"],[" ","ws"],["(","punct"],["int","type"],[" ","ws"],["i","ident"],[" ","ws"],["=","punct"],[" ","ws"],["1","number"],[";","punct"],[" ","ws"],["i","ident"],[" ","ws"],["<=","punct"],[" ","ws"],["n","ident"],[";","punct"],[" ","ws"],["i","ident"],["++)","punct"],[" ","ws"],["{","punct"]],[["        ","ws"],["if","kw"],[" ","ws"],["(","punct"],["i","ident"],[" ","ws"],["%","punct"],[" ","ws"],["15","number"],[" ","ws"],["==","punct"],[" ","ws"],["0","number"],[")","punct"]